Deliver a devastating axe kick dealing [133%, 155%, 172%, 187%, 200% (TL1-5)] damage. If the blow connects your target is brain damaged, causing all talents to fail for [0, 1, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] turns and earning 2 combo points.

This effect cannot be saved against, though it can be dodged and checks confusion immunity.
